WEBVTT

00:00.830 --> 00:03.980
Today, we'd like for you 
to do this one, miss.

00:06.870 --> 00:07.870
<i>Ow...</i>

00:10.480 --> 00:13.210
<i>I need to be careful not 
to dirty the furniture...</i>

00:14.860 --> 00:17.500
Oh, please excuse me, miss.

00:17.500 --> 00:19.200
That was on purpose, wasn't it?

00:19.200 --> 00:24.490
I mean, she's so dense, it's hard to 
believe she's related to our master.

00:25.240 --> 00:30.740
<i>The Evans took me in when I had 
nowhere to go after Mom died.</i>

00:30.740 --> 00:32.700
<i>I can put up with this...</i>

00:33.670 --> 00:35.750
B-Big sister?

00:38.620 --> 00:41.010
Good morning, Miss Natalia.

00:44.420 --> 00:45.700
Here's some medicine.

00:45.700 --> 00:46.900
Please use it.

00:46.900 --> 00:49.340
Th-Thank you...

00:51.710 --> 00:55.090
Dear sister, do you have time today?

00:55.090 --> 00:57.140
I'd like you to read me a book!

00:57.370 --> 01:01.150
I'm sorry, but not today, Miss Natalia.

01:01.370 --> 01:03.170
I see...

01:03.170 --> 01:05.020
I'll give up on the book.

01:05.020 --> 01:07.180
But I have another favor to ask!

01:07.180 --> 01:09.660
Wh-What could that be?

01:09.660 --> 01:13.290
I want us to get closer.

01:13.290 --> 01:16.930
So I'd like you to say my name 
without honorifics when we're alone!

01:17.630 --> 01:20.040
Pretty please?

01:22.090 --> 01:24.550
Very well... Natalia.

01:30.020 --> 01:34.610
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:59.240 --> 03:03.660
<b>Naughty Visit to the Parents</b>

03:07.700 --> 03:09.340
Where am I...?

03:10.400 --> 03:13.140
Charlotte's little sister is in trouble!

03:13.750 --> 03:15.110
Natalia...

03:25.440 --> 03:28.720
I never imagined I'd have to return so soon.

03:29.040 --> 03:31.490
So, by Charlotte's little 
sister, you mean...

03:31.840 --> 03:33.930
Natalia Evans.

03:34.360 --> 03:38.410
She's Charlotte's half-sister, 
and she's ten years younger.

03:38.410 --> 03:42.160
She's also the legitimate 
heir of the Evans family.

03:42.160 --> 03:44.160
How are things between Charlotte and her?

03:44.160 --> 03:48.800
In the Neruz Kingdom, she seemed to have 
been the only supporter Charlotte had.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.990
I see.

03:50.300 --> 03:51.760
Good morning.

03:52.150 --> 03:53.550
Good morning!

03:53.550 --> 03:55.000
Did you sleep well?

03:55.000 --> 03:58.240
Yes, thanks to your spell, Allen.

03:58.240 --> 04:01.490
That's good to hear... hm?

04:01.820 --> 04:03.390
Did something happen?

04:03.390 --> 04:06.760
Well, I had a dream about Natalia.

04:06.760 --> 04:08.200
I see.

04:08.200 --> 04:13.280
Um, I want you to know what 
kind of girl Natalia is.

04:13.280 --> 04:16.030
Yes, tell me about her.

04:16.430 --> 04:18.760
I want to listen to mommy's story!

04:18.760 --> 04:23.530
It's gotten awfully lively around 
you while I was away, bro.

04:23.880 --> 04:26.390
A fenrir and a hell capybara...

04:26.390 --> 04:29.040
Mom would be so delighted to see them!

04:29.730 --> 04:33.500
Does your mother know much 
about magical creatures?

04:33.500 --> 04:36.790
Yes, she is the leading expert 
on magical creature research.

04:37.060 --> 04:39.810
Even I get excited when I see you!

04:42.660 --> 04:44.520
It's been three years...

04:45.200 --> 04:48.790
This is the island where 
your alma mater is...

04:49.140 --> 04:51.800
Is that black building the school?

04:51.800 --> 04:54.240
That's a dormitory for students.

04:54.240 --> 04:56.630
What? Then where is the school?

04:56.630 --> 05:01.420
Well... this entire island 
is the Athena Magical Academy.

05:01.770 --> 05:02.690
Huh?!

05:09.210 --> 05:13.350
Most of the people on this island 
are associated with the academy,

05:13.350 --> 05:15.340
except for some tourists.

05:15.700 --> 05:17.650
And Natalia is here...

05:17.650 --> 05:21.830
I thought Ms. Natalia was in the Neruz Kingdom?

05:22.110 --> 05:23.400
Right?

05:23.400 --> 05:27.880
Natalia is most certainly here, all alone.

05:29.860 --> 05:33.100
I think it's high time 
you told us the details.

05:33.330 --> 05:36.850
It's a little complicated, so 
I'll tell you when we get home.

05:37.190 --> 05:38.470
Home...?!

05:38.710 --> 05:40.400
By home...

05:40.910 --> 05:43.470
Do you mean the home of your parents?

05:43.470 --> 05:45.010
That's right!

05:45.740 --> 05:47.540
I-I must give them a proper greeting.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.730
I'm going to prepare myself mentally!

05:49.730 --> 05:52.170
Charlotte, you'll be just fine!

05:52.170 --> 05:54.390
I'm more worried about my bro...

05:56.960 --> 05:58.950
Is Allen okay?

05:58.950 --> 06:03.150
Three years ago, bro quit 
school without telling anyone

06:03.150 --> 06:06.010
and left home after a 
big fight with our dad.

06:06.010 --> 06:07.470
A big fight?!

06:07.470 --> 06:09.520
I don't want to hear it.

06:09.790 --> 06:11.850
It's not a big deal, anyhow.

06:11.850 --> 06:13.260
You think so?

06:13.660 --> 06:17.940
The people of the island still talk about 
the big fight between you and Dad.

06:18.800 --> 06:22.770
Strong mages going at each other 
for three days and nights...

06:34.750 --> 06:36.820
Th-That sounds fierce...

06:36.820 --> 06:39.460
I'll show you the other 
side of the island later.

06:39.460 --> 06:43.690
The ruin from the fight's over there,
and it's almost like a sightseeing spot!

06:43.690 --> 06:45.430
I'd love to see that!

06:45.430 --> 06:46.970
I wouldn't recommend it.

06:46.970 --> 06:50.310
It's just gouged-out land. There's nothing to see.

06:53.920 --> 06:55.940
Even though you're not on 
good terms with them,

06:55.940 --> 06:59.300
you've yielded and are visiting your parents
for the sake of your beloved...

06:59.300 --> 07:02.700
What a dramatic story.

07:02.700 --> 07:04.680
Don't create a drama here!

07:04.680 --> 07:08.210
First of all, I have a good 
relationship with my uncle.

07:08.210 --> 07:10.700
We've been corresponding via mail.

07:10.700 --> 07:13.340
Hm? What do you mean by your uncle?

07:13.340 --> 07:16.190
Oh, I guess I didn't explain it to you.

07:16.190 --> 07:20.440
I lost my parents when I was small, 
and the Crawfords took me in.

07:20.440 --> 07:21.570
That's right!

07:21.570 --> 07:23.950
Bro is my stepbrother.

07:23.950 --> 07:26.550
But I'm actually a bit envious.

07:26.550 --> 07:28.470
Hm? Why is that?

07:28.470 --> 07:34.390
It's just that... I've never had a fight 
with my family, so I'm envious...

07:35.250 --> 07:37.210
You're meeting Natalia, right?

07:37.210 --> 07:40.340
Then build a relationship with 
her where you two can fight.

07:40.900 --> 07:42.510
You think I can?

07:43.200 --> 07:49.230
My becoming a wanted person must have 
caused trouble for Natalia as well.

07:49.230 --> 07:51.170
But it's a false accusation.

07:51.170 --> 07:53.730
I'm sure your sister understands.

07:54.870 --> 07:56.440
Don't worry about it.

07:56.440 --> 07:58.000
I'll lend you my aid too!

07:58.680 --> 08:00.630
For you, I will do any—

08:01.740 --> 08:04.180
I shall help as well!

08:04.180 --> 08:05.660
Me too! Me too!

08:05.660 --> 08:08.260
Th-Thank you, everyone.

08:08.700 --> 08:11.250
My parents and I are on your side too!

08:12.410 --> 08:13.250
Thank you.

08:13.510 --> 08:15.310
Get off me! You're heavy!

08:15.310 --> 08:16.890
How rude!

08:16.890 --> 08:19.030
You don't speak to a lady 
about her weight...

08:18.360 --> 08:20.010
You bastard!

08:20.010 --> 08:22.010
What do you want, fish guy?!

08:22.410 --> 08:23.850
You wanna go?!

08:23.850 --> 08:25.760
Oh, you wanna go?!

08:26.060 --> 08:28.260
In no time flat, there's another fight.

08:28.260 --> 08:31.690
I know disputes are an everyday occurrence 
on this island, but still...

08:31.690 --> 08:32.270
Hm?

08:34.480 --> 08:36.660
I guess I don't need to worry about it.

08:36.660 --> 08:37.790
Yup.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.430
But...

08:39.430 --> 08:40.780
Observe.

08:41.120 --> 08:43.290
Excuse me, may I have a word?

08:43.290 --> 08:44.680
What the hell?

08:44.680 --> 08:46.820
Get lost if you don't want 
to be collateral damage!

08:49.020 --> 08:51.800
My goodness, you children 
are giving me no choice.

08:55.560 --> 08:57.390
He's incredible.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.810
He reminds me of you, Allen.

08:58.810 --> 09:00.060
Indeed.

09:00.060 --> 09:03.420
He seems to be an experienced sorcerer.

09:03.420 --> 09:05.550
Hey, over here!

09:08.560 --> 09:11.060
It's been a while, Allen.

09:11.350 --> 09:13.280
You seem well.

09:13.280 --> 09:15.830
You really think so, 
under the circumstances?

09:16.220 --> 09:17.870
Eruca, thank you for your help.

09:17.870 --> 09:19.610
No problem!

09:21.460 --> 09:24.180
You must be the Charlotte I've 
heard so much about.

09:24.180 --> 09:27.590
Thank you very much for 
coming all the way here.

09:27.820 --> 09:30.090
N-Nice to meet you...

09:30.350 --> 09:34.100
By the way, I am Harvey Crawford.

09:34.100 --> 09:36.090
Allen and Eruca's dad.

09:37.420 --> 09:39.380
Th-Their dad?!

09:40.100 --> 09:43.100
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

09:43.100 --> 09:46.100
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

09:43.100 --> 09:46.100
<b>The Battlefield of the Crawford Father and Son</b>

09:48.590 --> 09:52.090
I'm relieved to see Allen is doing well.

09:52.090 --> 09:56.270
I'm overjoyed that you've brought 
home such an adorable girlfriend...

09:58.160 --> 09:59.000
Huh?!

09:59.000 --> 10:00.440
Charlotte isn't—

10:03.990 --> 10:06.500
<i>What on earth is she thinking?</i>

10:06.500 --> 10:09.270
<i>Has she prepped them 
so that they think</i>

10:09.270 --> 10:12.630
<i>I have a girlfriend and won't 
bring up </i>that<i> subject with me?</i>

10:13.010 --> 10:16.360
<i>Then I must ask Charlotte to work with me!</i>

10:18.870 --> 10:19.900
<i>Crap!</i>

10:19.900 --> 10:24.400
<i>I've mastered so many high-level spells, 
and here I am, struggling to wink...?!</i>

10:28.640 --> 10:32.640
M-My name is Charlotte Evans.

10:32.640 --> 10:34.400
Allen and I are in a relationship!

10:34.400 --> 10:38.660
<i>That's Charlotte for you, 
she read my mind perfectly!</i>

10:38.930 --> 10:41.390
What a polite lady you are.

10:41.390 --> 10:43.900
You're almost too good for Allen.

10:44.340 --> 10:46.860
Are you truly sure he has 
your consent to date?

10:46.860 --> 10:49.660
Y-Yes, I'm fully on board.

10:49.660 --> 10:53.420
And Allen is always so kind to me,

10:53.420 --> 10:56.050
teaching me all kinds of naughty things!

10:56.050 --> 10:57.310
Oh!

10:57.310 --> 10:59.040
Naughty things, huh?

10:59.040 --> 11:01.150
Charlotte, calm down a little bit!

11:01.150 --> 11:03.330
Don't make Uncle too happy for nothing!

11:03.330 --> 11:05.060
I-I'm sorry...

11:05.060 --> 11:06.900
She's Lü's mommy!

11:06.900 --> 11:07.810
Allen's—

11:09.080 --> 11:12.570
Eruca told me everything.

11:12.570 --> 11:14.460
If you ever find yourself in trouble,

11:14.460 --> 11:17.390
think of me as your 
father and rely on me.

11:17.390 --> 11:18.810
Th-Thank you.

11:19.540 --> 11:22.800
<i>How far did Eruca go with this story?</i>

11:24.460 --> 11:26.080
Well, I'm so glad!

11:26.080 --> 11:31.210
If you get married to Charlotte, I'm 
sure it'll help you settle down, Allen.

11:31.210 --> 11:33.200
G-Get married?!

11:33.510 --> 11:36.400
Oh, you haven't thought about it?

11:36.400 --> 11:38.720
So is this just a fun, casual relationship?

11:39.070 --> 11:41.060
O-Of course not—

11:41.060 --> 11:43.450
I'm relieved to hear that.

11:43.450 --> 11:45.240
If you're thinking of settling down,

11:45.240 --> 11:48.470
why won't you think about 
that offer once again?

11:48.470 --> 11:49.430
I refuse!

11:49.430 --> 11:51.970
As you can see, I'm dating 
Charlotte right now!

11:51.970 --> 11:54.970
And I've decided to make my current 
residence my forever home!

11:55.320 --> 11:57.600
Therefore, I have no intention 
of coming back here!

11:58.530 --> 12:03.110
Now now, take your time and 
give it some thought, okay?

12:03.350 --> 12:05.420
What is this "offer"?

12:05.420 --> 12:08.730
My dad is the headmaster 
of Athena Magical Academy,

12:08.730 --> 12:11.740
and he wants bro to take over the position.

12:12.030 --> 12:17.540
Being in charge of Athena Magical Academy, 
the venerable highest educational institute,

12:17.540 --> 12:20.890
would be an honor that will 
leave your mark in history.

12:20.890 --> 12:23.380
Isn't it a wonderful opportunity?

12:23.380 --> 12:26.020
A title usually comes with baggage.

12:26.020 --> 12:28.760
I don't want to be tied down 
by something like that!

12:28.760 --> 12:32.970
You, my son, are the only person 
who's able to take over after me.

12:32.970 --> 12:35.280
Even if we're not biologically related!

12:35.730 --> 12:38.020
What a wonderful father you have!

12:38.020 --> 12:39.240
Don't be fooled!

12:39.240 --> 12:41.020
That was just public rhetoric.

12:41.300 --> 12:44.140
The real reason he wants 
me to take over is...!

12:46.620 --> 12:48.540
Oh, hello.

12:49.810 --> 12:52.860
Are you by any chance
Allen's little sister?

12:52.860 --> 12:56.050
Nice to meet you, I'm Charlotte.

12:56.320 --> 12:58.660
A little sister? I'm so flattered.

12:58.660 --> 13:02.790
Charlotte, she's not my 
little sister, she my au—

13:04.050 --> 13:06.550
Oh please, my dear Allen.

13:06.550 --> 13:10.720
Have you forgotten what to
 call me after only three years?

13:10.720 --> 13:12.900
I'm sorry, "Mother."

13:12.900 --> 13:14.550
You're his mom?!

13:14.550 --> 13:16.730
I'm Liselotte Crawford.

13:16.730 --> 13:18.270
Nice to meet you!

13:19.720 --> 13:23.350
The real reason Uncle 
wants me to take over...

13:23.350 --> 13:24.480
It's so he can be with Au—

13:24.480 --> 13:28.200
with Mother all the time!

13:29.040 --> 13:32.570
Being a headmaster is indeed an honor.

13:32.570 --> 13:36.570
But I want to shove all of 
that on my son and retire,

13:36.570 --> 13:41.330
so I can spend every single 
day cuddling with my Lizzie!

13:41.330 --> 13:42.670
Learn to be <i>less</i> honest!

13:42.670 --> 13:44.750
Who do you think I <i>am</i>?!

13:45.710 --> 13:48.370
You're my sweet son.

13:48.370 --> 13:51.720
That's why I want to give you a 
new little sister or brother soon.

13:51.720 --> 13:53.720
Stop it, that's too graphic!

13:55.440 --> 13:58.020
I'm sorry we're so noisy.

13:58.020 --> 14:01.220
It shows you are a close family. I'm envious.

14:02.130 --> 14:03.580
Thank you for saying that.

14:03.580 --> 14:07.800
But you're already like a 
daughter to us, Charlotte.

14:07.800 --> 14:10.590
You can call me "Mama" or "Mom"—

14:09.550 --> 14:11.240
We don't need to do that again!

14:11.240 --> 14:14.190
Anyhow, let's talk about 
Charlotte's little sister.

14:14.190 --> 14:15.610
What exactly happened?

14:17.490 --> 14:21.660
She is... currently studying 
abroad at our academy.

14:21.660 --> 14:22.680
What?

14:22.680 --> 14:25.240
The Evans family seems to be in turmoil, 
so while they're figuring things out,

14:25.240 --> 14:29.910
she is seeking refuge here under 
the pretense of studying abroad.

14:29.910 --> 14:33.140
It's a common story for a 
child of a noble house.

14:33.470 --> 14:35.600
When did this happen?

14:35.600 --> 14:37.040
Three months ago.

14:37.040 --> 14:40.410
Then why didn't you tell 
us about this sooner?

14:40.810 --> 14:43.440
She used a fake identity.

14:43.440 --> 14:46.900
It's only recently that we found out 
she is Charlotte's little sister.

14:47.420 --> 14:51.650
<i>Charlotte fleeing the country 
was a well-known fact.</i>

14:52.260 --> 14:55.400
<i>I guess it's only natural that her 
sister tried to hide her identity.</i>

14:55.910 --> 15:00.030
But you didn't contact me just because 
you found out about Natalia, correct?

15:00.030 --> 15:01.100
Indeed.

15:01.100 --> 15:05.660
Recently, the factional rivalries inside 
the academy are getting worse.

15:05.660 --> 15:08.540
Oh, we saw a dispute at the port earlier.

15:08.790 --> 15:10.840
I know the current state of the academy.

15:10.840 --> 15:13.800
But how is that related to Natalia?

15:14.160 --> 15:17.300
Is Natalia getting tangled up in it...?

15:17.620 --> 15:20.400
It might be faster if we showed you.

15:20.960 --> 15:21.750
Eruca.

15:21.750 --> 15:22.310
Okay.

15:25.610 --> 15:27.990
This is the Mirror of Nostalgia,

15:27.990 --> 15:30.490
magical equipment that 
can show us another location.

15:39.110 --> 15:40.290
Natalia!

15:40.290 --> 15:42.570
<i>This is Charlotte's little sister...</i>

15:45.890 --> 15:46.840
Hold on!

15:47.110 --> 15:48.990
Who are they?!

15:48.990 --> 15:51.520
N-Natalia... is she okay?

15:51.520 --> 15:53.580
Observe and you'll see.

15:54.000 --> 15:55.740
How can you be so relaxed?!

15:55.740 --> 15:57.220
Never mind, I'll go and—

16:01.600 --> 16:03.620
I'd appreciate it if you didn't muck around.

16:05.900 --> 16:09.740
I thought I ordered you to 
go buy a yakisoba bread.

16:09.740 --> 16:10.400
Huh?

16:10.400 --> 16:10.980
Huh?

16:11.620 --> 16:13.110
I'm sorry, Boss Lady!

16:13.110 --> 16:15.230
The cafeteria ran out of 
yakisoba bread already...

16:15.600 --> 16:17.790
You can't even run errands.

16:17.790 --> 16:19.490
Is that body of yours only for show?

16:19.490 --> 16:22.070
Boss Lady, please contain your anger...

16:22.070 --> 16:23.610
We've got this instead, so...

16:23.610 --> 16:25.760
This croquette bread is 
actually pretty good.

16:26.090 --> 16:28.460
What's happening?

16:28.460 --> 16:31.520
It's been three months 
since Natalia joined us.

16:31.520 --> 16:34.330
She has grown at a speed that's 
rarely seen in history,

16:34.330 --> 16:38.770
and now reigns at the top 
of the factions in the academy.

16:38.770 --> 16:39.850
Huh?!

16:39.850 --> 16:43.570
We could have handled the 
situation using force,

16:43.570 --> 16:46.770
but we want our students to 
learn freely and comfortably.

16:46.770 --> 16:51.480
You used to be a troublemaker before, 
so I'm sure you can get along with her.

16:51.480 --> 16:53.700
Could you speak with her?

16:53.700 --> 16:57.290
I rushed over here, thinking that 
Charlotte's little sister was in danger...

16:57.290 --> 17:00.100
Oh my gosh, what do I do, Allen?!

17:00.100 --> 17:03.780
Natalia's a bad girl now!

17:03.780 --> 17:07.370
The fact is, she isn't that bad.

17:07.370 --> 17:08.300
Look.

17:08.660 --> 17:12.740
I promise I'll get you a yakisoba 
bread next, so please spare me!

17:12.740 --> 17:14.790
Oh, and here's your change.

17:15.120 --> 17:17.070
You keep it.

17:17.050 --> 17:17.600
What?

17:17.600 --> 17:19.720
But it's 30 silvers!

17:19.720 --> 17:21.310
I couldn't possibly receive that much.

17:21.610 --> 17:24.890
You think I don't know that 
you're working a lot of shifts

17:24.890 --> 17:27.490
at your part-time job to 
send money to your family?

17:28.240 --> 17:32.140
I couldn't be a Boss Lady if I 
couldn't provide for my lackies.

17:32.140 --> 17:34.070
So, keep the change.

17:34.500 --> 17:35.760
B-Boss Lady!

17:35.760 --> 17:37.200
Thank you so much!

17:37.200 --> 17:40.040
I'll pay back your kindness 
for the rest of my life!

17:39.460 --> 17:40.840
Good for you.

17:40.040 --> 17:41.660
That's our Boss Lady for you.

17:42.310 --> 17:45.610
As you can see, she is respected.

17:45.610 --> 17:48.080
As expected of Charlotte's little sister.

17:48.080 --> 17:49.120
I'm glad.

17:49.120 --> 17:51.940
Her kindness hasn't changed at all.

17:51.940 --> 17:56.680
Lady Charlotte, was your little
sister like that at home?

17:57.200 --> 17:58.930
Not at all.

17:59.470 --> 18:02.540
She never used to do this before.

18:02.540 --> 18:05.040
Did you communicate this to her family?

18:05.040 --> 18:06.470
Of course.

18:06.470 --> 18:09.240
But her family also seemed 
to be in such disarray...

18:09.950 --> 18:15.090
<i>A sheltered noble girl sent to an isolated 
island and neglected by her parents...</i>

18:15.090 --> 18:16.980
<i>Of course she would go bad.</i>

18:17.310 --> 18:22.250
Is it because of me that Natalia 
has changed like that?

18:22.250 --> 18:26.610
Unfortunately, it is possible that it
was one of many different reasons.

18:28.620 --> 18:31.640
Tell us, Uncle. What do you want to do?

18:31.640 --> 18:35.250
The academy respects the 
freedom of the students.

18:35.250 --> 18:37.870
But in her case, she's gone too far.

18:38.450 --> 18:43.710
Can you persuade her to hold it back a 
little and attend class more seriously?

18:44.140 --> 18:46.400
I'm sorry about my sister.

18:46.780 --> 18:51.650
<i>She's only misbehaving, so it wouldn't 
affect me if we left her as is, but...</i>

18:52.590 --> 18:55.520
Fine. I suppose I'm an old hand at this.

18:55.780 --> 18:58.520
Leave it to me to handle troublemakers!

18:58.520 --> 18:59.840
Allen!

18:59.840 --> 19:01.640
That's my Allen for you!

19:01.640 --> 19:03.030
You're so reliable.

19:03.030 --> 19:04.220
Good!

19:04.220 --> 19:06.360
And while you're at it,

19:06.360 --> 19:08.670
you can go ahead and take over 
my position as the headmaster...

19:08.670 --> 19:10.250
That is <i>never</i> happening!

19:11.540 --> 19:14.990
Anyhow, I'm going to try 
and talk to Natalia first.

19:14.990 --> 19:17.240
Charlotte, what do you want to do?

19:17.240 --> 19:18.560
I...

19:18.910 --> 19:22.050
It might be wise to see how things go.

19:22.050 --> 19:23.040
Okay.

19:23.040 --> 19:29.090
But if you so desire, it's possible to let 
you see her while hiding your identity.

19:29.090 --> 19:30.550
Is that possible?

19:30.550 --> 19:32.670
With my magic, it is.

19:32.670 --> 19:36.330
But depending on how it goes, 
that might be painful for you.

19:36.330 --> 19:37.830
Do you still want to meet her?

19:38.220 --> 19:41.930
I... haven't done anything 
an older sister should,

19:41.930 --> 19:45.230
except for reading her 
books a few times...

19:45.230 --> 19:50.010
But she would still call me "Big sister."

19:50.560 --> 19:55.030
It was the only fond memory 
I have of that house.

19:55.500 --> 19:58.000
If I run away right now, I'll regret 
it for the rest of my life.

19:58.530 --> 20:01.340
So please let me see Natalia!

20:01.660 --> 20:03.600
Very good, well said!

20:03.600 --> 20:06.500
Yay! Saying hello to mommy's little sister!

20:06.500 --> 20:11.110
Have no fear, Lady Charlotte, 
for we are with you.

20:11.510 --> 20:12.850
Oh, everyone...

20:12.850 --> 20:16.430
Uncle, I'll need you to 
forge an ID for Charlotte.

20:16.430 --> 20:19.200
She's going to infiltrate the 
academy as my assistant!

20:19.200 --> 20:20.840
No problem at all.

20:20.840 --> 20:24.110
Bro, that's like a legit naughty thing!

20:24.110 --> 20:26.540
But it's already getting late today,

20:26.540 --> 20:28.610
so we should pick this up tomorrow, okay?

20:28.610 --> 20:30.510
Yes, you're right.

20:30.510 --> 20:34.340
We've arranged accommodations 
near here, so please excuse us—

20:34.340 --> 20:35.620
What are you talking about?

20:35.620 --> 20:38.780
Of course we've prepared 
 rooms for all of you.

20:38.780 --> 20:41.430
But... I'm sure Charlotte 
doesn't feel comfortable

20:41.430 --> 20:44.150
staying at someone else's home... right?

20:44.820 --> 20:45.670
See?

20:45.670 --> 20:48.380
Lottie says she wants to stay here!

20:48.380 --> 20:50.120
She didn't say anything!

20:50.120 --> 20:53.020
You know how they say,
"Silence means saying yes."

20:53.020 --> 20:54.900
I've <i>never</i> heard that one!

20:54.900 --> 20:57.800
Plus, if you think about 
the safety of Lottie,

20:57.800 --> 20:59.390
this house is the best choice, you know?

20:59.390 --> 21:01.980
<i>She's got a point there.</i>

21:03.770 --> 21:05.190
Alright, that's settled!

21:05.190 --> 21:07.400
I'll prepare your rooms!

21:07.770 --> 21:10.790
<i>I'm getting a bad feeling about this...</i>

21:12.380 --> 21:14.410
Here's your room!

21:14.770 --> 21:17.150
Hey, why is there only <i>one</i> bed?!

21:17.150 --> 21:19.360
You two are lovers, aren't you?

21:19.360 --> 21:21.360
Then of course you sleep 
in the same bed, right?

21:21.360 --> 21:22.670
Well, that's...

21:22.950 --> 21:27.680
You're not saying you were lying 
about being lovers, are you?

21:27.680 --> 21:30.190
O-Of course not...

21:30.400 --> 21:33.560
If I'm being lied to by my dear Allen,

21:33.560 --> 21:36.440
I'll be so sad that I  
don't know what I'd do.

21:36.440 --> 21:38.690
Th-There's no way I'd lie—

21:38.690 --> 21:41.700
Good! Sweet dreams!

21:44.280 --> 21:47.320
<i>Th-This situation is really bad...</i>

21:47.600 --> 21:48.980
Allen...

21:48.980 --> 21:50.820
Y-Yes...?

21:51.430 --> 21:54.150
We have an early morning tomorrow, so...

21:54.150 --> 21:55.820
Shall we go to bed?

23:30.950 --> 23:32.850
What an innocent couple, no?

23:32.850 --> 23:35.290
My dear Allen was totally 
thrown off balance.

23:35.290 --> 23:37.320
Next time is, "Naughty Reunion."

23:35.350 --> 23:40.050
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.350 --> 23:40.050
<b>Naughty Reunion</b>

23:37.320 --> 23:39.320
Let's go to bed to remember our beginning.

23:39.320 --> 23:40.110
Oh my!
